{"type":"message","id":"5bc80589","parentId":"4089ed14","timestamp":"2026-06-01T11:15:40.351Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Cloudflare Workers error 1101 is a JavaScript runtime error - meaning the worker itself is crashing. Let me check what the issue might be.\n\nError 1101: \"JavaScript runtime error\" - this means the worker code itself has a bug and is throwing an exception before it can even authenticate.\n\nThe GET /history worked fine with X-API-Key header, but POST /send is returning 1101. This is likely a bug in the worker's POST handler, not an auth issue.\n\nLet me try with different Content-Type or different body format.","thinkingSignature":"d20391f804147a304d87c87c96ea0b80c01f6f24fdc9dd77ae5d85845889052e"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n错误1101是Cloudflare Workers的JavaScript运行时错误，说明worker代码本身有问题。GET成功但POST失败说明是worker的POST处理器有bug。让我换种方式尝试：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_1c0e681d5b2848b49b4632b5","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  --data-raw '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\"}' \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: text/plain\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":178,"output":246,"cacheRead":23360,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23784,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780312536400,"responseId":"066c9cd88fe0bcece8ba9ddee07e2570"}}
